  (text "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 (octal PSRAM: GPIO35-37 reserved). Strapping pins 0/3/45/46 left at defaults.\nAFE on SPI2 (GPIO9-14,21,47,48), microSD 4-bit SDMMC (GPIO1,2,38-42), I2C IMU + fuel gauge (GPIO4/5)."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
